<title>JAPAN: Nissan April domestic output up 17.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Nissan April domestic output up 17.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nissan Motor Co Ltd said on Thursday its domestic vehicle production rose 17.8 percent in April from a year earlier to 135,542 units.  </p>
<p>Nissan's domestic vehicle production, exports, domestic sales and overseas output in April were as follows:</p>
<p>    Production	  135,542   up    17.8 percent</p>
<p>    Domestic sales     68,889   down   5.5 percent</p>
<p>    Exports		58,512   up    32.7 percent</p>
<p>    Overseas output   101,680   up    23.0 percent</p>
</text>
